ng out small with a hotel for business travelers, your challenge is to build a successful business, overcoming all obstacles that the exciting world of business management can provide.\n\nYou have the opportunity to place the hotel virtually at any location and have total control over the look and atmosphere of your foyer, guest rooms and all the other components that go into making a top hotel.\n\nSuccess or failure is only a holiday season away – so start your career now and build up your own hotel imperium.\nFeatures:\n\n• Various different hotel types (urban, resort, theme-hotels)\n\n• Cool advertising possibilities \n\n• Different accommodations (guest rooms, restaurants, bar, fitnesscenter...)\n\n• Realistic and detailed simulation\n\n• Lovely crafted interior and design possibilities","aboutGame":null},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/502460/header.jpg?t=1728936956"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/502460/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1728936956"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/502460/ss_7b9832996e4f9dad5591abc11f6960a4225e6b5d.600x338.jpg?t=1728936956","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/502460/ss_7b9832996e4f9dad5591abc11f6960a4225e6b5d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1728936956"},{"id":1,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/502460/ss_4bf9f4b4aa83dbed6bed6ceecd18f50e65eede12.600x338.jpg?t=1728936956","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/502460/ss_4bf9f4b4aa83dbed6bed6ceecd18f50e65eede12.1920x1080.jpg?t=1728936956"},{"id":2,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/502460/ss_942ef8caf48c7e3f055